{
 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 61.28,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，找出每一处除法，写下余数归谁。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，找出每一处除法，写下余数归谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-01.wav",
   "start": 4.78,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 4.78,
   "speechEnd": 8.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "审计的人，逐个检查 unchecked 块，类型转换，内联汇编和移位。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，逐个检查 unchecked 块，类型转换，内联汇编和移位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-02.wav",
   "start": 9.08,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 9.08,
   "speechEnd": 14.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "做测试的人，把同一操作重复 1000 次，看误差流向谁。",
   "spoken": "做测试的人，把同一操作虫复 1000 次，看误差流向谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-03.wav",
   "start": 14.82,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 14.82,
   "speechEnd": 19.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "普通用户，别当新金库的第一个存款人。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，别当新金库的第一个存款人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-04.wav",
   "start": 19.68,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 19.68,
   "speechEnd": 23.671
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "存入后马上核对份额。是 0 或明显偏少，立刻停下。",
   "spoken": "存入后马上核对份额。是 0 或明显偏少，立刻停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-05.wav",
   "start": 24.14,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 24.14,
   "speechEnd": 28.765
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "跨链转账时，核对同一代币在两条链上的精度。",
   "spoken": "跨链转账时，核对同一代币在两条链上的精度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-06.wav",
   "start": 29.16,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 29.255,
   "speechEnd": 33.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。只错一点点的取整，怎么变成约 9480 万美元的损失？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。只错一点点的取整，怎么变成约 9480 万美元的损失？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-07.wav",
   "start": 33.86,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 33.86,
   "speechEnd": 42.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "因为余数给错了人，而且这一步，能在一笔交易里重复很多次。",
   "spoken": "因为余数给错了人，而且这一步，能在一笔交易里虫复很多次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-08.wav",
   "start": 43.24,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 43.24,
   "speechEnd": 47.932
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-09",
   "text": "反过来，只要余数始终归协议，重复多少次，也抠不出钱。",
   "spoken": "反过来，只要余数始终归协议，虫复多少次，也抠不出钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-09.wav",
   "start": 48.34,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 48.34,
   "speechEnd": 53.591
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-10",
   "text": "下一集讲外部调用与代币兼容性。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲外部掉用与代币兼容性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-10.wav",
   "start": 54.0,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 54.0,
   "speechEnd": 57.018
  }
